    "name": "Poppa’s Pride",
    "instructions": "1. Add bourbon, ginger juice, lemon wedges and mint to cocktail shaker.\n2. Add ice and shake until chilled.\n3. Strain into a highball or Collins glass over fresh ice.\n4. Top with soda water and Angostura bitters (don't be shy about the bitters).\n5. Garnish with a mint sprig.",
